                <pb facs="0171" n="51" sameAs="frus:frus1932v01/pg51"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15A4/898: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Acting Chairman of the American Delegation (Gibson)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-03-03T16:00:00-05:00">March 3, 1932—4
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>27. Your 54, March 2, 9 p.m. The Department concurs in your conclusions as to
                    method of procedure.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
